<title>USA: Tel-Save Holdings OKs 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Tel-Save Holdings OKs 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HOPE, Pa. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tel-Save Holdings Inc said Friday it had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable on or about January 31, record January 17.</p>
<p>&quot;The split should bring the per share price into a more favorable trading range, broaden the distribution of the shares, and provide increased liquidity,&quot; Chairman and Chief Executive Daniel Borislow said in a statement.</p>
</text>
